Description:
    Scaffolds an agent definition under app/agents/NAME/ and its Ruby class.

Example:
    bin/rails generate managed_agents:agent support_triage --deployments daily --vault

    creates:
        app/agents/support_triage/agent.md
        app/agents/support_triage/environment.yaml
        app/agents/support_triage/vault.yaml
        app/agents/support_triage/deployment-daily.yaml
        app/agents/support_triage_agent.rb
